WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.973
Aunt Sunny and Tom are very busy.

2
00:00:03.974 --> 00:00:09.457
So we’re going to see a movie.

3
00:00:09.458 --> 00:00:12.358
Mom: What movie do you want to see?

4
00:00:12.359 --> 00:00:15.444
Hana: The Unicorn Princess.

5
00:00:15.445 --> 00:00:20.164
Mom: How about The Adventures of Max the Wonder Dog

6
00:00:20.165 --> 00:00:23.526
? Hana & Bada:

7
00:00:23.527 --> 00:00:26.681
Okay! Mom: One adult and two children,

8
00:00:26.682 --> 00:00:31.822
please. Hana: We’re going to see The Adventures of Max the Wonder

9
00:00:31.823 --> 00:00:34.806
Dog. Clerk: Okay. Enjoy the

10
00:00:34.807 --> 00:00:37.678
show! Mom: Thank

11
00:00:37.679 --> 00:00:40.108
you. Do you want some popcorn?

12
00:00:40.109 --> 00:00:41.849
Hana & Bada: Yes!

13
00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:44.790
Bada: Can I have some juice

14
00:00:44.791 --> 00:00:49.522
too? Hana: Nothing for me,

15
00:00:49.523 --> 00:00:52.564
thanks. Mommy, where do we sit?

16
00:00:52.565 --> 00:00:55.107
Mom: You can sit wherever you like.

17
00:00:55.108 --> 00:00:56.499
Bada: Really?

18
00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:02.335
Mom: See? There are no seat numbers.

19
00:01:02.336 --> 00:01:06.368
Hana: Bada, can you pass me the popcorn?

20
00:01:06.369 --> 00:01:10.699
Mommy! Bada won’t give me the popcorn. Mom:

21
00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:14.269
Bada! Voice-over

22
00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:18.462
: Meet Max! The wonder dog!

23
00:01:18.463 --> 00:01:21.087
Bada: The movie’s starting, Hana!

24
00:01:21.088 --> 00:01:27.089
Hana: I know! Give me the popcorn!

25
00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:29.758
It was a great movie!

26
00:01:29.759 --> 00:01:36.215
Have you seen any good movies lately?

